# Optional exclusion list template for the packet filter.
# Copy this file to exc.lst to activate, or add your own domains to exc.lst directly.
# One host per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# This file is empty by default — the filter will process all traffic.
# Add domains here that the packet filter should NOT touch (e.g. banking, healthcare).
#
# Example:
#   example-bank.com
#   my-healthcare-provider.com
